.com/news/cyber-verification-program</guid><source>Anthropic News</source><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>行业动态</category><category>AI安全</category></item><item><title>OpenAI 在维基媒体项目中发现“恶意”Agent 活动</title><link>https://simonwillison.net/2026/Oct/7/openai-rogue-agents-wikimedia/</link><description>OpenAI 在维基媒体项目中发现疑似“恶意”Agent 活动，引发对 AI Agent 滥用和内容操纵的讨论。</description><guid>https://simonwillison.net/2026/Oct/7/openai-rogue-agents-wikimedia/</guid><source>Simon Willison</source><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 08:16:45 +0800</pubDate><category>行业动态</category><category>AI安全</category></item><item><title>AWS 发布基于 AgentCore 和 OpenClaw 构建上下文感知 AI 助手教程</title><link>https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/building-a-context-aware-ai-assistant-on-agentcore-and-openclaw/</link><description>AWS 发布博客，展示如何利用 AgentCore 和 OpenClaw 构建上下文感知的 AI 助手，解决现成助手在上下文理解上的不足。</description><guid>https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/building-a-context-aware-ai-assistant-on-agentcore-and-openclaw/</guid><source>AWS ML Blog</source><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 03:19:15 +0800</pubDate><category>Agent框架</category><category>AWS</category><category>教程</category></item><item><title>Vercel AI Gateway 新增基于置信度的决策回退功能</title><link>https://vercel.com/changelog/confidence-based-decision-fallbacks</link><description>Vercel AI Gateway 新增功能，当主模型对决策请求的置信度不足时，可自动升级到回退模型，提高决策可靠性。</description><guid>https://vercel.com/changelog/confidence-based-decision-fallbacks</guid><source>Vercel News</source><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 01:19:00 +0800</pubDate><category>Agent框架</category><category>Vercel</category></item><item><title>GitHub 构建面向 Agent 规模开发的 Git 基础设施</title><link>https://github.blog/engineering/architecture-optimization/building-git-infrastructure-for-agent-scale-development/</link><description>GitHub 博客介绍其为支持 Agent 规模开发而构建的 Git 基础设施，以应对 AI 编程 Agent 带来的大量代码操作需求。</description><guid>https://github.blog/engineering/architecture-optimization/building-git-infrastructure-for-agent-scale-development/</guid><source>GitHub Blog</source><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 04:57:56 +0800</pubDate><category>GitHub</category><category>基础设施</category></item><item><title>Google 将于 10 月 9 日移除 Gemini 免费版对 Flash 和 Pro 的访问</title><link>https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1005451/google-gemini-free-flash-lite-only</link><description>自 10 月 9 日（2026年10月9日）起，Google Gemini 免费版用户将无法再使用 Flash 和 Pro 模型，仅限使用 Flash Lite。</description><guid>https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1005451/google-gemini-free-flash-lite-only</guid><source>The Verge AI</source><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 21:19:01 +0800</pubDate><category>行业动态</category><category>Gemini</category></item><item><title>OmniReasoning：推动音视频联合推理极限</title><link>https://x.com/_akhaliq/status/2107532766858694847</link><description>新论文 OmniReasoning 发布，聚焦于推动音视频联合推理的性能极限，并公开了论文链接。</description><guid>https://x.com/_akhaliq/status/2107532766858694847</guid><source>Twitter @_akhaliq</source><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 02:05:42 +0800</pubDate><category>论文与研究</category><category>多模态</category></item><item><title>Musubi 发布轻量级 AI 决策模型，用于实时内容审核</title><link>https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/06/how-ai-decision-models-could-change-content-moderation/</link><description>Musubi 宣布推出轻量级决策模型，专为实时内容审核设计，可能改变内容审核的方式。</description><guid>https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/06/how-ai-decision-models-could-change-content-moderation/</guid><source>TechCrunch AI</source><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 04:35:20 +0800</pubDate><category>产品与发布</category><category>内容审核</category></item><item><title>ALoDLM：自适应循环扩散语言模型</title><link>https://x.com/_akhaliq/status/2107532442181808351</link><description>新论文 ALoDLM 提出自适应循环扩散语言模型，探索扩散模型在语言建模中的新应用，并公开论文链接。</description><guid>https://x.com/_akhaliq/status/2107532442181808351</guid><source>Twitter @_akhaliq</source><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 02:04:24 +0800</pubDate><category>论文与研究</category><category>扩散模型</category></item><item><title>Rill Browser：让 Claude Code 和 Codex 在浏览器中协同工作</title><link>https://www.product